              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "U-Asriya umpristi omkhulu nabo bonke abapristi bambheka, bheka, wayenochoko ebunzini lakhe, bamkhiphela ngaphandle; yebo, naye washesha ukuphuma, ngokuba uJehova wayemshayile.",
          "type": "text",
