              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inkosi u-Uziya yayinochoko kwaze kwaba sosukwini lokufa kwayo, futhi wayehlala ezindlini eziningi ngoba yayinochoko; uJothamu indodana yakhe wayephezu kwendlu yenkosi, ahlulela abantu bezwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.21",
