            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "U-Uziya wayeselala koyise, bammbela koyise emhlabathini wokumbela wamakhosi; ngokuba bathi: “Unochoko; uJothamu indodana yakhe waba yinkosi esikhundleni sakhe.”",
